  "description": "A bike purpose-built for gravel racing, the Kaius 01 ONE proves you can be aero, responsive, and brutally fast on dirt. Generation two of this gravel race bike pushes this idea even harder.\nAerodynamics are sharpened again, delivering a measured 7% gain at 40 km/h. Power transfer is more direct thanks to our 01 Premium Carbon layup, leading to a more responsive ride. Compliance, 52mm tire clearance and high-speed stability have all been refined so you can rip the turns and stay planted when corners come fast and the surface stops cooperating.\nThe build matches the brief. A full SRAM Red XPLR AXS groupset with direct-mount rear derailleur and power meter keeps everything precise when fatigue sets in. The next-gen ICS Carbon Aero cockpit locks in a low, race-ready position, keeping the front end ultra-clean. CG39 SL Carbon tubeless wheels with carbon spokes give a compliant yet super responsive ride.",
